  "description": "KA.Barcode Reader for Codabar from PDF is a VB.NET barcode scanner library to read, scan Codabar barcode from PDF in your ASP.NET Core web and Windows applications.\n\nThis package includes detailed example VB.NET source code to scan, read, decode Codabar data message from PDF file in .NET projects.\n\nGuides:\n* How to Guide : https://www.keepautomation.com/guide/vbnet_barcode_reader.html\n* Email : support@keepautomation.com",
